 "lead": "These are the trains I would look at if you’re using the Cheltenham Racecourse Park and Ride for the Royal International Air Tattoo. Get the train to Cheltenham Spa, then a taxi or local bus to the racecourse, about 3 miles away, and the Park and Ride bus takes about an hour and a half to the Yellow entry. The buses only leave every hour, so I’ve worked out which one you’re likely to catch. Pick your station, a day and a time below.",
