 "ysh3b": "Park and Ride back to Cheltenham",
 "walkLine": "Cheltenham Racecourse is about 3 miles from the station, so I would book a taxi, or take a local bus into Prestbury. The Park and Ride leaves from the racecourse bus pickup area, and RIAT asks you to be there at least 15 minutes before your bus. It takes about an hour and a half and drops you at the Yellow entry. Tickets are limited and have to be bought in advance.",
